Let me rewrite the whole <script> section and panel header. Easiest: rewrite the template file entirely.

Let me do that with the write tool (overwrite template), then regenerate the final html.

Let me be careful with the globe.gl API: `world.controls()` returns OrbitControls (three). `enableZoom`, `autoRotate`, `autoRotateSpeed`. Setting `world.controls().enableZoom = false` works.

